            "text": "As a shopper in Sydney, New South Wales, you have several excellent online options for buying halal lollies that deliver across Australia.\n\nHere are some of the best places to find them:\n\n*   **Global Sweets & Lollies** is a major online store offering a wide selection of certified halal sweets, including lollies, gummies, chocolates, and chewy treats. They provide fast delivery to Sydney and other major Australian cities.\n*   **Chocablock** provides halal chocolates, lollies, and candy online, with fast Australia-wide delivery. They focus on meeting halal standards without compromising on flavour.\n*   **Sweet As** offers a premium collection of halal-certified lollies and chocolates, made with certified halal gelatin and are alcohol-free. They also have bulk options available, perfect for parties or events.\n*   **Online Lolly Shop (Lolly Warehouse)** delivers halal lollies across Australia, including Sydney, offering a diverse range to choose from.\n*   **Tiny Sugar Gems** specializes in 100% halal-certified lollies, available in gift boxes or for individual enjoyment. They highlight unique flavours and offer options for gluten-free halal lollies.\n*   **Modesty Collection** imports high-quality halal lollies, chocolates, and confectionery primarily from Malaysia and Turkey, ensuring 100% halal certification.\n*   **Sweet Pickings Lolly Shop Australia** has \"The Halal Lolly Mix,\" a certified halal assortment of sweet, sour, and fizzy lollies perfect for sharing.\n*   **Candy Bar Sydney** offers wholesale distribution of Fresha Cadbury halal-certified candy, including popular Australian favourites, which could be an option for bulk purchases."
          }
